# CrackNQT Frontend — Project Init / Analysis

> TCS NQT exam preparation platform. Analysis generated Nov 2026.
> Note: This repo root IS the frontend project (despite also containing a stray nested `frontend/` directory).

---

## 1. Framework & Dependencies

### Core stack
- **Next.js 16.2.3** — App Router, React Server Components, route groups.
  ⚠ This Next version has breaking changes vs. common training data (see `AGENTS.md`; docs live in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`).
- **React 19.2.4** / **react-dom 19.2.4**
- **TypeScript 5** — strict mode, path alias `@/*` → `./src/*` (plus `./frontend/src/*`, see issues).
- **Tailwind CSS v4** via `@tailwindcss/postcss` — no `tailwind.config.*`; theme is CSS-variable based in `src/app/globals.css` (~484 lines, oklch colors, light/dark).
- **shadcn/ui** (`components.json`, style `base-nova`) + **@base-ui/react** primitives, **class-variance-authority**, **clsx**, **tailwind-merge**, **tw-animate-css**.

### App-specific libraries
- **Zustand 5** — client state (`src/stores/`):
  - `auth-store` — tokens/user in localStorage, hydration, login/logout
  - `test-store` — active exam session (section-locked progress, question statuses, per-question timers, tab-switch violations, `attemptDead` handling)
  - `progress-store` — analytics data (dashboard, topics, trends, recommendations)
- **Axios** — HTTP client; Bearer interceptor, 401 → silent token-refresh with request queue, redirect to `/login` on failure (`src/lib/api/client.ts`).
- **Recharts** — performance charts (analytics/results).
- **framer-motion** — animations.
- **lucide-react** — icons.
- **sonner** — toast notifications.
- **next-themes** — system/light/dark theme.
- **Razorpay-style premium payment flow** — premium payment page (`/premium/payment`).
- **Env var**: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (only one) — backend REST API base URL (default `http://localhost:5000/api`).

### Tooling
- ESLint 9 + `eslint-config-next`
- `next/font` (Geist), `next/image`, `next/script`
- `src/app/sitemap.ts`, `src/app/robots.ts` — SEO
- Scripts: `dev` (next dev) · `build` (next build) · `start` (next start) · `lint` (eslint)
- **No test framework installed.**

