### How it fits together
- **Route groups**: `(auth)` = login/register · `(public)` = SEO/marketing pages · `(main)` = authenticated shell with shared Navbar/Footer. `exam/[testId]` is outside all groups — full-screen, chrome-free.
- **Data flow**: Components / Zustand stores → `lib/api/*` modules → shared Axios client → backend REST API (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`). Responses wrapped in `ApiResponse<T>`; types centralized in `lib/api/types.ts`.
- **Auth**: localStorage access/refresh tokens, hydrated on mount via `providers.tsx` → Zustand. 401 → single queued refresh call; failure → redirect `/login`.
- **Exam system**: section-locked sections (numerical → reasoning → verbal → advanced), question statuses (`not_visited` / `not_answered` / `answered` / `marked_for_review`), per-question timing, tab-switch detection, `usePreventCopy`, localStorage backup of in-progress answers, `attemptDead` flag to stop API spam after a backend 400.
- **SEO**: metadata-rich root layout, `sitemap.ts`, `robots.ts`, JSON-LD, static-content pages (syllabus / cutoff / preparation).

